   6:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *          functionalities of the General Purpose Input/Output (GPIO) peripheral:
   8:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *           + IO operation functions
  10:stm/stm32l4xx/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *
